OL,3,ABody found in search for missing Noah
OL,4,AWoods, 3
OL,5,
OL,6,FA body has been found in the search for
OL,7,Fmissing three-year-old boy Noah Woods,
OL,8,Fpolice have confirmed.
OL,10,FNoah disappeared at about 15:00 BST on
OL,11,FTuesday from a playground in Brantham,
OL,12,FSuffolk, after becoming separated from
OL,13,Fa relative.
OL,15,FSupt Tom Pearse of Suffolk Police said
OL,16,Fdive teams recovered the body of a
OL,17,Fchild from a nearby pond.
OL,19,FHe said the death was being treated as
OL,20,Funexplained but not suspicious.
